        "Codex is a third, independent read of the diff"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "The rules",
      "items": [
        "Two evaluator rounds at most; a third means the plan is wrong",
        "The pre-commit hook and CI run the same typecheck, lint, format and tests; never bypassed",
        "Merge is fast-forward after my approval; the next task waits for my go"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What it caught",
      "items": [
        "Poll before submit, so a dead account never spends another cent",
        "The review carousel re-sorting under a thumb",
